**/.DS_Store
node_modules
**/.env
.serena
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
.worktree-setup.log

# --- Key material ------------------------------------------------------------
# The runbooks (DEPLOYMENT.md, pkgs/extensions/discord-bot/docs/turnkey-setup.md)
# have you generate verifier / Turnkey stamper keys on disk inside a package
# directory before pushing them into Workers Secrets. They are supposed to be
# deleted right after, but a stray `git add -A` in between must never publish one.
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.der
*.private
*.jks
*.keystore
*.asc
*.gpg
id_rsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*

# Cloudflare Workers local secrets (`wrangler dev` reads these)
**/.dev.vars
**/.dev.vars.*

# Every .env variant (.env.base, .env.local, .env.production, ...) except the
# committed templates. Plain `**/.env` above does not match these suffixed forms.
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
